":"REQ-CONNECT-009","level":"MUST","text":"CleanSession=1 时，Client 和 Server MUST 丢弃此前 Session 并启动新 Session。"},{"id":"REQ-CONNECT-010","level":"DEFINITION","text":"CleanSession=1 创建的 Session 与网络连接具有相同生命周期。"},{"id":"REQ-CONNECT-011","level":"MUST NOT","text":"CleanSession=1 创建的 Session 数据 MUST NOT 在后续 Session 中复用。"},{"id":"REQ-CONNECT-012","level":"DEFINITION","text":"Keep Alive 是以秒为单位并表示为 16 位字的时间间隔。"},{"id":"REQ-CONNECT-013","level":"MUST","text":"ClientId 标识 Client，并且 Client 与 Server MUST 用它标识该 MQTT Session 的状态。"},{"id":"REQ-CONNECT-014","level":"MUST","text":"ClientId MUST 存在，并且 MUST 是 CONNECT payload 的第一个字段。"},{"id":"REQ-CONNECT-015","level":"MUST","text":"ClientId MUST 是 MQTT UTF-8 字符串。"},{"id":"REQ-CONNECT-016","level":"MUST","text":"Server MUST 接受长度为 1 至 23 个 UTF-8 编码字节且仅含规定字母数字字符的 ClientId。"},{"id":"REQ-CONNECT-017","level":"MUST","text":"Server MUST 验证 CONNECT 符合第 3.1 节；不符合时关闭网络连接且不发送 CONNACK。"},{"id":"REQ-CONNECT-018","level":"MUST","text":"CONNECT 验证成功时，Server MUST 发送 return code 0 的 CONNACK。"},{"id":"REQ-CONNECT-019","level":"DEFINITION","text":"CONNECT 的 MQTT Control Packet type 值是 1。"},{"id":"REQ-DATA-001","level":"DEFINITION","text":"16 位整数以大端顺序在线上传输，高位字节在低位字节之前。"},{"id":"REQ-DISCONNECT-001","level":"DEFINITION","text":"DISCONNECT 是 Client 发给 Server 的最后一个 Control Packet，表示 Client 正常断开。"},{"id":"REQ-DISCONNECT-002","level":"MUST","text":"Server MUST 验证 DISCONNECT reserved bits 为 0；否则断开 Client。"},{"id":"REQ-DISCONNECT-003","level":"DEFINITION","text":"DISCONNECT 没有 variable header。"},{"id":"REQ-DISCONNECT-004","level":"DEFINITION","text":"DISCONNECT 没有 payload。"},{"id":"REQ-DISCONNECT-005","level":"MUST","text":"Client 发送 DISCONNECT 后 MUST 关闭网络连接。"},{"id":"REQ-DISCONNECT-006","level":"MUST NOT","text":"Client 发送 DISCONNECT 后 MUST NOT 在该网络连接上继续发送 Control Packet。"},{"id":"REQ-DISCONNECT-007","level":"SHOULD","text":"Server 收到 DISCONNECT 后，如果 Client 尚未关闭网络连接，Server SHOULD 关闭该连接。"},{"id":"REQ-DISCONNECT-008","level":"DEFINITION","text":"DISCONNECT Remaining Length 为 0。"},{"id":"REQ-DISCONNECT-009","level":"DEFINITION","text":"DISCONNECT 的 MQTT Control Packet type 值是 14。"},{"id":"REQ-ERROR-001","level":"MUST","text":"除非另有规定，Client 或 Server 遇到协议违规时 MUST 关闭收到引发违规 Control Packet 的网络连接。"},{"id":"REQ-ERROR-002","level":"MUST","text":"处理入站 Control Packet 时发生 Transient Error，Client 或 Server MUST 关闭收到该报文的网络连接。"},{"id":"REQ-ERROR-003","level":"SHOULD","text":"Server 检测到 Transient Error 时 SHOULD NOT 断开其他 Client，也不应影响与其他 Client 的交互。"},{"id":"REQ-FRAME-001","level":"DEFINITION","text":"Remaining Length 等于当前报文中 variable header 与 payload 的字节数，不包含 Remaining Length 自身的编码字节。"},{"id":"REQ-FRAME-002","level":"DEFINITION","text":"Remaining Length 使用每字节七个数据位和一个 continuation bit 的变长编码，最多使用四字节。"},{"id":"REQ-FRAME-003","level":"DEFINITION","text":"fixed header 第一个字节的 7-4 位是四位无符号 MQTT Control Packet 类型。"},{"id":"REQ-FRAME-004","level":"MUST","text":"标为 Reserved 的 fixed-header flag MUST 使用 Table 2.2 规定的值；收到非法 flags 时接收方 MUST 关闭网络连接。"},{"id":"REQ-FRAME-005","level":"DEFINITION","text":"MQTT Control Packet type 值 0 是 Forbidden。"},{"id":"REQ-FRAME-006","level":"DEFINITION","text":"MQTT Control Packet type 值 15 是 Forbidden。"},{"id":"REQ-KEEPALIVE-001","level":"MUST","text":"Keep Alive 非零时，若 Server 在一点五倍 Keep Alive 时间内没有收到 Client 的任何报文，MUST 断开该 Client 的网络连接，视同网络故障。"},{"id":"REQ-KEEPALIVE-002","level":"DEFINITION","text":"Keep Alive 值为 0 时关闭保活机制，Server 不因 Client 不活动而断开连接。"},{"id":"REQ-KEEPALIVE-003","level":"MUST","text":"Keep Alive 非零时，Client MUST 发送报文；在没有其他报文可发送的情况下 MUST 发送 PINGREQ。"},{"id":"REQ-PING-001","level":"DEFINITION","text":"PINGREQ 由 Client 发往 Server，用于向 Server 表明 Client 存活、请求 Server 响应以确认存活，并维持网络连接活动。"},{"id":"REQ-PING-002","level":"DEFINITION","text":"PINGREQ 没有 variable header 也没有 payload，Remaining Length 为 0。"},{"id":"REQ-PING-003","level":"MUST","text":"Server 收到 PINGREQ 后 MUST 返回 PINGRESP。"},{"id":"REQ-PING-004","level":"DEFINITION","text":"PINGRESP 没有 variable header 也没有 payload，Remaining Length 为 0。"},{"id":"REQ-PING-005","level":"DEFINITION","text":"PINGREQ 的 MQTT Control Packet type 值是 12。"},{"id":"REQ-PING-006","level":"DEFINITION","text":"PINGRESP 的 MQTT Control Packet type 值是 13。"},{"id":"REQ-PUBLISH-001","level":"DEFINITION","text":"PUBLISH 从 Client 发往 Server 或从 Server 发往 Client，用于传输 Application Message。"},{"id":"REQ-PUBLISH-002","level":"MUST","text":"QoS 0 的发送方 MUST 使用 QoS=0、DUP=0 的 PUBLISH。"},{"id":"REQ-PUBLISH-003","level":"MUST NOT","text":"QoS=0 的 PUBLISH MUST NOT 包含 Packet Identifier。"},{"id":"REQ-PUBLISH-004","level":"DEFINITION","text":"PUBLISH Remaining Length 等于 variable header 与 payload 的长度之和。"},{"id":"REQ-PUBLISH-005","level":"MUST","text":"Topic Name MUST 是 PUBLISH variable header 的第一个字段，并且 MUST 是 MQTT UTF-8 字符串。"},{"id":"REQ-PUBLISH-006","level":"MUST NOT","text":"PUBLISH Topic Name MUST NOT 包含通配符。"},{"id":"REQ-PUBLISH-007","level":"DEFINITION","text":"PUBLISH payload 包含 Application Message，并且允许长度为零。"},{"id":"REQ-PUBLISH-008","level":"DEFINITION","text":"Client 使用 PUBLISH 向 Server 发送 Application Message，以分发给具有匹配订阅的 Clients。"},{"id":"REQ-PUBLISH-009","level":"DEFINITION","text":"Server 使用 PUBLISH 向每个具有匹配订阅的 Client 发送 Application Message。"},{"id":"REQ-PUBLISH-010","level":"MUST","text":"因匹配既有订阅而向 Client 发送 PUBLISH 时，Server MUST 设置 RETAIN=0。"},{"id":"REQ-PUBLISH-011","level":"DEFINITION","text":"PUBLISH 的 MQTT Control Packet type 值是 3。"},{"id":"REQ-SESSION-001","level":"MUST","text":"Client 和 Server MUST 在整个 Session 生命周期内保存 Session state。"},{"id":"REQ-SESSION-002","level":"DEFINITION","text":"Server 的 Session state 包含 Client 的 subscriptions。"},{"id":"REQ-STRING-001","level":"DEFINITION","text":"MQTT UTF-8 字符串具有两字节长度前缀，编码后的字符串不得超过 65535 字节。"},{"id":"REQ-STRING-002","level":"MUST","text":"UTF-8 字符串 MUST 是格式良好的 UTF-8；收到含非法 UTF-8 的 Control Packet 时接收方 MUST 关闭网络连接。"},{"id":"REQ-STRING-003","level":"MUST NOT","text":"UTF-8 字符串 MUST NOT 包含 U+0000；收到含 U+0000 的 Control Packet 时接收方 MUST 关闭网络连接。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBACK-001","level":"DEFINITION","text":"SUBACK 确认 SUBSCRIBE 的接收和处理。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBACK-002","level":"DEFINITION","text":"SUBACK Remaining Length 等于两字节 variable header 加 payload 的长度。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBACK-003","level":"MUST","text":"SUBACK return codes 的顺序 MUST 与 SUBSCRIBE Topic Filters 的顺序一致。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBACK-004","level":"MUST NOT","text":"SUBACK 仅可使用 return code 0x00、0x01、0x02、0x80，其他值 MUST NOT 使用。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBACK-005","level":"DEFINITION","text":"SUBACK 的 MQTT Control Packet type 值是 9。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBACK-006","level":"DEFINITION","text":"Server 可以授予比 Client 请求更低的 maximum QoS，因此对请求 QoS 1 或 QoS 2 的 Subscription 回复 Success - Maximum QoS 0 是允许的。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBSCRIBE-001","level":"DEFINITION","text":"SUBSCRIBE 创建一个或多个 Subscription；每个 Subscription 注册 Client 对一个或多个 Topic 的兴趣。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBSCRIBE-002","level":"MUST","text":"SUBSCRIBE fixed-header flags MUST 是 0,0,1,0；其他值视为 malformed 并关闭网络连接。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBSCRIBE-003","level":"MUST","text":"SUBSCRIBE MUST 包含非零 16 位 Packet Identifier。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBSCRIBE-004","level":"MUST","text":"SUBSCRIBE payload 中的 Topic Filters MUST 是 MQTT UTF-8 字符串。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBSCRIBE-005","level":"MUST","text":"SUBSCRIBE payload MUST 至少包含一个 Topic Filter/QoS 对；空 payload 是协议违规。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBSCRIBE-006","level":"MUST","text":"Requested QoS 字节的高六位为 reserved；reserved 位非零或 QoS 不为 0、1、2 时，Server MUST 将 SUBSCRIBE 视为 malformed 并关闭连接。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBSCRIBE-007","level":"MUST","text":"Server 收到 SUBSCRIBE 时 MUST 回复 SUBACK。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBSCRIBE-008","level":"MUST","text":"SUBACK Packet Identifier MUST 与其确认的 SUBSCRIBE Packet Identifier 相同。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBSCRIBE-009","level":"MUST","text":"SUBACK MUST 为每个 Topic Filter/QoS 对包含一个表示 granted maximum QoS 或失败的 return code。"},{"id":"REQ-SUBSCRIBE-010","level":"DEFINITION","text":"SUBSCRIBE 的 MQTT Control Packet type 值是 8。"},{"id":"REQ-TOPIC-001","level":"MUST NOT","text":"Server 进行订阅匹配时 MUST NOT 规范化 Topic Name 或 Topic Filter，也不得修改或替换无法识别的字符。"},{"id":"REQ-TOPIC-002","level":"DEFINITION","text":"Topic Filter 中每个非通配层必须与 Topic Name 对应层逐字符相同，匹配才成功。"},{"id":"REQ-TOPIC-003","